WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.552
Anika: Traffic is flat. Input sizes look normal too. No obvious surge.
流量没有明显变化，输入大小看起来也正常，没有明显激增。

2
00:00:06.552 --> 00:00:11.713
Lukas: Any change in the data mix? More unique keys could grow a cache.
数据组成有没有变化？不同键值变多，也可能让缓存增长。

3
00:00:11.713 --> 00:00:17.449
Anika: Nothing obvious in the samples. We can't rule that out completely yet.
抽样没发现明显变化，但现在还不能完全排除。

4
00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:23.090
Raj: Worker-two is the only canary. The other two still run the older build.
worker-two是唯一的灰度节点，另外两台仍运行旧版本。

5
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.354
Hannah: That helps explain the difference. It doesn't prove which code change caused it.
这有助于解释差异，但不能证明具体是哪处代码变化导致的。

6
00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:35.114
Priya: Just to confirm, no more rollout, right? Keep this to one host.
我确认一下，先不继续发布，对吧？把范围保持在一台主机。

7
00:00:35.114 --> 00:00:40.491
Lukas: Agreed. Freeze the rollout while we gather evidence and plan recovery.
同意。收集证据、准备恢复期间冻结发布。

8
00:00:40.491 --> 00:00:46.035
Anika: I'm on it. Let's circle back to the cache change after recovery.
我来处理。恢复后我们再回到缓存变更上。

9
00:00:46.035 --> 00:00:52.444
Hannah: I'll keep an eye on the healthy workers. Don't overload them while we investigate.
我会关注健康消费者，排查期间别把它们压垮。

10
00:00:52.444 --> 00:00:59.380
Raj: The canary is growing again already. We've probably got a short window for diagnostics.
灰度节点的内存已经又开始涨了，留给诊断的时间可能不长。

